"dur":6.12},{"i":1,"at":50.832,"dur":4.944},{"i":1,"at":56.126,"dur":2.976},{"i":1,"at":64.102,"dur":6.024},{"i":1,"at":70.476,"dur":2.88},{"i":1,"at":78.297,"dur":7.2},{"i":1,"at":85.847,"dur":3.12},{"i":1,"at":94.026,"dur":4.896},{"i":0,"at":99.272,"dur":6.24}],"speech":[{"actor":"rana","start":0.45,"text":{"en":"Welcome to Auto Maintenance, Book 1. This is Unit 5, The Service Process, from check-in to handover.","ar":"أهلاً بكم في صيانة السيارات، الكتاب الأوّل. هذه الوحدة الخامسة، عمليّة الصيانة، من الاستقبال إلى التسليم."},"id":"L001"},{"actor":"rana","start":8.6,"text":{"en":"This is Part 3, Explaining the Process. You will hear all seven steps in order, told to a customer.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثالث، شرح العمليّة. ستسمع الخطوات السبع كلّها بالترتيب، تُشرَح لعميل."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"rana","start":16.222,"text":{"en":"Before you listen, think about this. What is the first step when a car arrives?","ar":"قبل أن تستمع، فكّر في هذا. ما الخطوة الأولى عندما تصل سيارة؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"rana","start":22.164,"text":{"en":"Let me explain what happens to your car.","ar":"دعني أشرح لك ما يحدث لسيارتك."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"rana","start":25.274,"text":{"en":"First, it is booked in here at reception, and a job card is made.","ar":"أوّلاً، تُسجَّل هنا في الاستقبال، وتُعدّ لها بطاقة عمل."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"rana","start":30.352,"text":{"en":"Then it is taken to the workshop, where it is inspected and serviced.","ar":"ثمّ تُنقَل إلى الورشة، حيث تُفحَص وتُصان."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"rana","start":35.262,"text":{"en":"If there is a fault, it is diagnosed by our technician.","ar":"وإن كان هناك عطل، يُشخَّص من قبل فنّيّتنا."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"rana","start":39.38,"text":{"en":"After the work, the car is road-tested and checked by the quality team.","ar":"بعد العمل، تُختبَر السيارة على الطريق وتُفحَص من قبل فريق الجودة."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":44.362,"text":{"en":"Finally, it is cleaned and handed over to you. Every step is written on the job card.","ar":"وأخيراً، تُنظَّف وتُسلَّم إليك. وكلّ خطوة تُكتب على بطاقة العمل."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"tarek","start":50.832,"text":{"en":"Now say whether each sentence is true, false, or not given.","ar":"الآن قل إن كانت كلّ جملة صحيحة أو خاطئة أو غير مذكورة."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"tarek","start":56.126,"text":{"en":"The car is booked in at reception.","ar":"تُسجَّل السيارة في الاستقبال."},"subHold":7.976,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"tarek","start":64.102,"text":{"en":"True. That is the first step, and a job card is made at the same time.","ar":"صحيحة. تلك هي الخطوة الأولى، وتُعدّ بطاقة العمل في الوقت نفسه."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"tarek","start":70.476,"text":{"en":"The car is serviced at reception.","ar":"تُصان السيارة في الاستقبال."},"subHold":7.821,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"tarek","start":78.297,"text":{"en":"False. It is serviced in the workshop. Reception books it in and hands it over.","ar":"خاطئة. تُصان في الورشة. والاستقبال يسجّلها ويسلّمها."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"tarek","start":85.847,"text":{"en":"The car is cleaned before handover.","ar":"تُنظَّف السيارة قبل التسليم."},"subHold":8.179,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"tarek","start":94.026,"text":{"en":"True. Finally, it is cleaned and handed over.","ar":"صحيحة. وأخيراً، تُنظَّف وتُسلَّم."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"rana","start":99.272,"text":{"en":"Three phrases to keep: first, it is; then it is; and finally, it is handed over.","ar":"ثلاث عبارات احفظها: first, it is؛ و then it is؛ و finally, it is handed over."},"id":"L017"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"b58c8220566a6f9e","bytes":46800,"sha":"21328ed89a7743f6","address":"lines/b58c8220566a6f9e.mp3"},{"key":"23c32f9d35dc416d","bytes":43632,"sha":"c7a327282c94d04d","address":"lines/23c32f9d35dc416d.mp3"},{"key":"ed7074f9ac6d7e32","bytes":33552,"sha":"5182206bf23ee6c8","address":"lines/ed7074f9ac6d7e32.mp3